<http://data.silknow.org/object/8fb057f7-9d02-361d-a55a-629e5d2427dc/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Kerchief of pink figured silk with a white silk warp and pink silk weft. The field is covered with flower sprigs and the border has a meander of flower heads with leaves in the curves, and are marked off by fancy edgings. There are selvedges at the side from which a portion of the pink silk weft floats free as a fringe. The ends have a white warp fringe."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/8fb057f7-9d02-361d-a55a-629e5d2427dc> .

